  '武器决定战斗方式：剑和长枪是近战，弓弩是远程，法杖是魔法，都不用带箭或符文。': 'Your weapon sets your combat style: swords and spears are melee, bows and crossbows are ranged, and staves are magic. Neither needs arrows or runes.',
