  '精英和首领会掉福袋、宝箱和首领宝藏，首领还有专属战利品和极少掉落的专属战旗。': 'Elites and bosses drop lucky bags, chests and boss hoards. Bosses also have their own trophies and very rare personal banners.',
  '按 L 打开日志，能看到每次击杀、阵亡和采集的记录。': 'Press L for the log, which records every kill, death and gathering action.',
